{"ID":"20240205164739-da8bbyx","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205164739-da8bbyx","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205164739-da8bbyx\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205164739-g13uw52\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240616172245-hm5f3o3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:5695,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240607131211-7obpar3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:7,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:7\u0026#125;","title":"079沙参","type":"doc","updated":"20240807194034"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240205164739-g13uw52","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205164739-g13uw52","updated":"20240807182158"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"北沙参（珊瑚菜）"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"（沙参一般指北沙参）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240206081645-vr37fjq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206081645-vr37fjq","updated":"20240206081656"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产于山东、江苏、河北、辽宁等地。\n【性状】\t长圆柱形，偶有分枝。表面淡黄白色，偶有外皮残存，全体有细纵皱纹及纵沟，并有棕黄色点状细根痕。顶端常留有棕黄色根茎残基，上端稍细，中部略粗，下部渐细。质脆，易折断，断面皮部浅黄白色，木部黄色。气特异，味微甘。\n【性味】\t甘，微苦，微寒。\n【功效】\t养阴清肺，益胃生津。用于肺热燥咳、劳嗽痰血、热病津伤口渴。"}]},{"ID":"20240206081642-jr3frv4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206081642-jr3frv4","updated":"20240206081642"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206081642-27p9h4l.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205165607-oi9hvtt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":